do CelyneLoop.play_bgm()
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/PART OF YOUR WORLD.png" fade="0.0"]
join Celyna center
join Seyche left [animation="Fade In" length="0.0"]
Celyna: Dear? What’s wrong..
Seyche: Oh! Nothing, it’s just.. Something that I heard today.
Celyna: You know you can tell me anything...
Seyche (Uncomfortable): Well, something Ermir told me has been on my mind for a bit.
Seyche: It’s about.. Styrmir, and well, me.
Celyna: .....
[wait time="1.0"]
Celyna: Styrmir.. He did something in the past.. To you.
Seyche: ..How? I wasn’t even here until a few months ago.. And I never met this Styrmir guy.
Celyna: Seyche, This isn’t your first time here. You’ve been here before.
Seyche (Surprised): I-I have? How have I not remembered anything?
Celyna: Back then, Styrmir disliked your worshippers and he had warned you about it.
Celyna: You’ve told me about it.
Celyna: Then you didn’t listen.. And the rest… Well, Styrmir never went back on his word.
Seyche (Normal): ... Oh…